OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786384108
OL,3,CAnother heatwave on the way - is this
OL,4,Cbecoming the new normal?
OL,6,FAfter a summer of unbroken sunshine,
OL,7,Frecord-breaking temperatures and very
OL,8,Flittle meaningful rain, the weather
OL,9,Fstory is becoming increasingly
OL,10,Ffamiliar: more heat is heading our way.
OL,12,FTemperatures of around 31C were
OL,13,Frecorded on Sunday and are expected to
OL,14,Fpush into the mid-30s early this week.
OL,15,FBy Wednesday, highs of 35C are
OL,16,Fexpected, with the possibility of 36C
OL,17,Fon Thursday in some locations.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
