CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786384108
OL,3,CAnother heatwave on the way - is this
OL,4,Cbecoming the new normal?
OL,6,FThis summer has been defined by
OL,7,Frepeated bursts of exceptional heat,
OL,8,Fprolonged dry weather and clear skies.
OL,10,FThe question is whether we are looking
OL,11,Fat a series of separate heatwaves, or
OL,12,Fa season-wide shift towards a hotter,
OL,13,Fdrier climate.
OL,15,FThe only recent summer where
OL,16,Ftemperatures were below or near
OL,17,Faverage was 2024 when we struggled to
OL,18,Fget to 25C in July ` this the
OL,19,Fexception rather than the rule.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
