OL,3,CAnother heatwave on the way - is this
OL,4,Cbecoming the new normal?
OL,6,FWhy does this heat keep returning and
OL,7,Fwhat is driving the repeated hot
OL,8,Fspells?
OL,10,FThe atmosphere is not simply producing
OL,11,Fone-off hot days this summer.
OL,13,FWe're seeing a combination of home
OL,14,Fgrown heat from sunny conditions day
OL,15,Fon day ` keeping temperatures
OL,16,Fregularly above average in many
OL,17,Flocations.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
