PN,30906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786384108
OL,3,CAnother heatwave on the way - is this
OL,4,Cbecoming the new normal?
OL,6,FHigh pressure has been the dominant
OL,7,Fweather feature since the May heatwave
OL,8,F` keeping it calm and dry as well
OL,9,Fsunny.
OL,11,FThe positioning of our atmospheric
OL,12,Fweather systems has meant we have also
OL,13,Fdrawn in hotter air from the south,
OL,14,Fsouthwest and near the Continent where
OL,15,Ftemperatures have been close to 40C
OL,16,Fagain this summer.
OL,18,FWill this become the new normal?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
