OL,3,CAnother heatwave on the way - is this
OL,4,Cbecoming the new normal?
OL,6,FRepeated extremes have become
OL,7,Fnormalised this summer ` everyone has
OL,8,Fbecome desensitised to information
OL,9,Fwhen it comes to high temperatures and
OL,10,Frecords.
OL,12,FThe numbers may start to sound
OL,13,Frepetitive but the impacts, from
OL,14,Fstressed water supplies and
OL,15,Fagriculture to health risks and
OL,16,Funcomfortable nights, remain very real.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
