CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786384108
OL,3,CAnother heatwave on the way - is this
OL,4,Cbecoming the new normal?
OL,6,FNext week's heat may feel like a
OL,7,Ffamiliar story, but the wider climate
OL,8,Fmessage is becoming harder to ignore:
OL,9,Fsummers like this are no longer just
OL,10,Fbreaking records ` they are changing
OL,11,Four expectations of what summer can be.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/8
